  m_text: 'Bacon ipsum dolor amet beef ham pork chop beef ribs leberkas. Burgdoggen
    pork loin meatloaf ham hock bacon drumstick jowl landjaeger bresaola t-bone buffalo
    ground round pastrami chislic ball tip. Prosciutto jerky corned beef ham flank,
    pork loin t-bone alcatra drumstick shankle spare ribs filet mignon ribeye. Andouille
    ribeye tri-tip prosciutto salami cupim chuck tongue pork chop chislic buffalo
    short ribs pork venison. Shankle pig boudin short loin, strip steak ham pork
    beef tenderloin beef ribs tail sirloin tri-tip frankfurter jerky. Salami ground
    round pork loin ball tip bresaola jowl beef chuck short loin prosciutto. Ribeye
    pork belly shoulder, cow rump beef ribs pork sirloin ham.


    Ham hock cow
    chuck frankfurter. Brisket sausage shank porchetta prosciutto bresaola venison
    meatloaf drumstick chislic filet mignon short ribs pastrami beef ribs cow. Spare
    ribs sirloin tail capicola meatloaf jowl kielbasa burgdoggen tri-tip hamburger
    alcatra. Biltong brisket beef ribs, filet mignon tongue swine ham shankle kevin
    venison. Ground round jerky ribeye, burgdoggen tri-tip kevin salami cow tenderloin
    capicola. Chuck jerky short loin pig frankfurter. Biltong bacon pork chop doner,
    turkey ribeye spare ribs ground round leberkas meatball.'
